  "description_short": "Family-friendly Wilderness restaurant serving hearty meals with a welcoming atmosphere near the lagoon.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Dumbleton Crescent in Wilderness, Amare Vita offers a relaxed dining experience that feels like visiting friends for a good meal. The restaurant has built a loyal following among locals and visitors who appreciate honest, well-prepared food without pretension.\n\nThe menu covers all the bases with generous portions that won't leave anyone hungry. Whether you're after a leisurely breakfast before exploring the Garden Route, a casual lunch, or a family dinner, the kitchen delivers reliable favourites in a comfortable setting. The location puts you close to Wilderness's stunning lagoon and beaches, making it a convenient stop after a day outdoors.\n\nWhat sets Amare Vita apart is its genuine warmth and family-friendly approach. The staff create a welcoming atmosphere where groups of all sizes feel at home, and the reasonable prices mean you can bring the whole family without breaking the bank.",
